Subject: [PATCH 4/8 RFC] dt-bindings: power: add the Meson8b VDEC power domain ID

Meson8b brings VDEC1 up through two AO sleep bits and two isolation bits
that no mainline driver owns today. Give the domain an ID so the pwrc
driver and the device tree can refer to it.

---
diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/power/meson8-power.h b/include/dt-bindings/power/meson8-power.h
index 7a55ba2..c3fa477 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/power/meson8-power.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/power/meson8-power.h
@@ -9,5 +9,6 @@
 #define PWRC_MESON8_VPU_ID			0
 #define PWRC_MESON8_ETHERNET_MEM_ID		1
 #define PWRC_MESON8_AUDIO_DSP_MEM_ID		2
+#define PWRC_MESON8_VDEC_ID			3
 
 #endif /* _DT_BINDINGS_MESON8_POWER_H */
